```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI as vdm_live.py
    participant Dash as Dash App
    participant Frontend as Frontend Service
    participant FS as Filesystem<br/>(runs/)
    
    User->>CLI: python vdm_live.py --runs-root runs/
    CLI->>CLI: Parse args (runs_root, host, port)
    CLI->>CLI: Set env vars (RUNS_ROOT, DASH_HOST, DASH_PORT)
    CLI->>Frontend: build_app(runs_root)
    Frontend->>Frontend: Initialize Dash app
    Frontend->>Frontend: Register callbacks
    Frontend->>Frontend: Build layout (workspace, charts, feed)
    Frontend-->>CLI: Return app instance
    CLI->>Dash: app.run(host=127.0.0.1, port=8060, debug=False)
    Dash->>Dash: Start HTTP server
    Dash-->>User: Dashboard ready at http://127.0.0.1:8060
    
    User->>Dash: Open browser → http://127.0.0.1:8060
    Dash->>Frontend: Render layout
    Frontend->>FS: List run directories
    FS-->>Frontend: [run1, run2, ...]
    Frontend-->>Dash: Dropdown options
    Dash-->>User: Show UI (select run)
    
    loop Polling Interval (1s)
        User->>Dash: Dashboard open
        Dash->>Frontend: Interval callback
        Frontend->>FS: Tail events.jsonl
        FS-->>Frontend: New events
        Frontend->>Frontend: Parse JSONL
        Frontend->>Frontend: Update Series model
        Frontend->>Dash: Update charts (Plotly)
        Dash-->>User: Refresh charts
    end
    
    Note over User,FS: Read-Only Monitoring<br/>No control loop back to runtime
```
